              "en": "The version of Riders on the Storm featuring Snoop Dogg and the Doors makes the soundtrack's meeting of periods and styles immediately recognisable. Alongside rap, the game includes rock and electronic music in a selection that accompanies both racing tension and the more relaxed time of the garage and exploration. Music does not simply describe speed: it gives continuity to a city permanently immersed in night. Repeating a route can mean rediscovering a track, associating a junction with a sound or taking a musical discovery beyond the game. The song catalogue becomes part of the memory of the place, without Bayview needing to correspond to a real city."
            },
