              "en": "Street challenges, shops to discover and different racing disciplines prevent Bayview from being a backdrop consumed only once. Players develop habits: recognising an area, remembering an entrance and checking a vehicle again after a modification. Progression remains organised by the game, but is experienced with a degree of initiative that changes the perception of time. This overlap makes Underground 2 more specific than a simple sum of races and accessories. The customised car, music and journeys between events support one another. Victory ends a race; it does not necessarily end the evening, because there is still another road to choose before switching off."
